  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おはよう、めぐる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "0000"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日は『HAREBARE!!』の日なんだな\r\n聞きながら来たのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "108"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016110020,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あ、音漏れしてた！？\r\nうわー、電車で迷惑になっちゃったかも……",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200301611/2003016110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、イヤホンを外したから聞こえただけだよ\r\n付けてる状態ならわからなかったから、大丈夫だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016110030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そっか、よかった！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301611/2003016110030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016110040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "明日ちょっと頑張らないといけないことがあってね……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301611/2003016110040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016110050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "今から自分で自分に気合を入れてるところー！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301611/2003016110050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、なるほどな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "鼓舞してもらうのに本当にいい曲だよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016110060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ねー！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301611/2003016110060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016110070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "──って、ちょっと自画自賛すぎかな……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301611/2003016110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016110080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "でもでも、曲も歌詞も最高だもん！\r\nわたしがそれに応えられたかはちょっと自信ないけど……！",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301611/2003016110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやいや、めぐるも最高の仕事をしたよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016110090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへ……\r\nだとしたら、プロデューサーのおかげ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301611/2003016110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか？\r\n俺は何もしてないけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016110100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "してくれたよー！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301611/2003016110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016110110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "『HAREBARE!!』はわたし宛の曲でもあるよって\r\n教えてくれた！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301611/2003016110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016110120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だからね……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301611/2003016110120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016110130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたしは背中を押してもらった状態で\r\nレコーディングに臨めて──",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301611/2003016110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016110140,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたしの歌が、声が……\r\n聞いてくれる人だけじゃなくて",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301611/2003016110140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016110150,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "『HAREBARE!!』に関わったみーんなの背中を\r\n押せますようにって思えたんだよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301611/2003016110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016110160,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "力不足かもしれないってちょっぴり不安な気持ちを、\r\n『HAREBARE!!』が支えてくれたんだ",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301611/2003016110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016110170,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そう思えたのは、プロデューサーがいてくれたからだよー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301611/2003016110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんか照れるなぁ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016110180,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えー！　なんで？\r\n全部素直な気持ちだよー！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301611/2003016110180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だからだよ\r\nストレートな言葉は照れる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016110190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ふふふっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301611/2003016110190"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0328",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016110200,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "歌ってほんとすごいね",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301611/2003016110200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016110210,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "聞けばいつだって100％で応援してくれて",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301611/2003016110210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016110220,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "でも、聞かないこともできる",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301611/2003016110220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016110230,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "頑張れない時は遠ざけておけるから……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301611/2003016110230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ほしい時にほしいものをくれる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016110240,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301611/2003016110240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016110250,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "今日のわたしみたいに『やるぞー！』って日は\r\nたっくさん聞いて気合い入れられるんだもん",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301611/2003016110250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016110260,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ちょっと……ちょっとかな……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301611/2003016110260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016110270,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "張りきりすぎちゃって、全力で『背中を押します！』\r\nって感じが出ちゃった気がするけど！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301611/2003016110270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、いいんじゃないか！",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それがめぐるの『HAREBARE!!』への意気込みだからさ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──全力がほしい人に届くといいよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003016110280,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
